#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:5
msgid "Edit category"
msgstr "编辑类别"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:7
msgid "Working with collections can only be done from `collections panel`_."
msgstr "集合的相关操作只能在 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 中进行。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"`collections panel`_."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:13
msgid ""
"Right click on the user collection or at a category from the collection "
"which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击用户集合，或右键单击集合中要编辑的类别。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:18
msgid "Figure: Options at folder"
msgstr "图：文件夹上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:20
msgid ""
"Click the option **Edit folder** to open **Add a new category** PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "单击 **编辑文件夹** 选项，打开 **添加新类别** 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:25
msgid "Figure: New category PopUp window"
msgstr "图：新建类别弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:27
msgid ""
"Edit the category name or add a new translation from the category name "
"pressing **Add a line**."
msgstr "编辑类别名称，或单击 **添加行** 为类别名称添加新的译文。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:28
msgid "Press **OK** to change the category properties."
msgstr "单击 **OK** 更改类别属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_folder.rst:32
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works according `ISO 639-1`_ norm. The folder name language is "
"defined using 2 letter code which should be used at the language column from"
" the folder internal name table."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 遵循 `ISO 639-1`_ 规范。文件夹名称的语言使用两位字母代码定义，该代码应填写在文件夹内部名称表的语言列中。"
